<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan weekly forex reserves fall to $1.690 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan weekly forex reserves fall to $1.690 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's foreign</p>
<p>exchange reserves fell to $1.690 billion on June 14 from $1.734</p>
<p>billion on June 7, compared to $2.014 billion a year ago, the</p>
<p>State (central) Bank of Pakistan said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    (BLN DLRS)		June 14    June 7    June 13, 1996</p>
<p>TOTAL			   1.690	1.734     2.014</p>
<p>Forex in Pakistan	   0.803	0.803     0.818</p>
<p>Forex outside Pakistan    0.214	0.258     0.503</p>
<p>Gold coins and bullion    0.672	0.672     0.692</p>
<p>Special Drawing Rights    0.001	0.001     0.001</p>
<p>-- Karachi Newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
